# Albert FE — Dependencies & Tooling

> **Purpose:** This document lists every important dependency, dev-dependency, and configuration file.

---

## 1. Root Package

```
name: albert-fe
private: true
workspaces: ["packages/*", "apps/*"]
```

### Root Scripts (Run from repo root)

| Script                         | What it does                                           |
| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| `npm run build:ui-kit`         | Runs the ui-kit build (no-op)                          |
| `npm run build:mf-causes`      | Builds the Causes micro frontend                       |
| `npm run build:mf-causes:mock` | Builds Causes in development mode                      |
| `npm run build:host`           | Builds the host shell                                  |
| `npm run build`                | Full build in order: ui-kit -> mf-causes -> host       |
| `npm run preview:mf-causes`    | Previews the built Causes MF                           |
| `npm run preview:host`         | Previews the built host shell                          |
| `npm run dev:mf-causes`        | Starts Causes in dev mode (port 5001)                  |
| `npm run dev:host`             | Starts host in dev mode (port 5000)                    |
| `npm run dev:exemple`          | Starts example-components in dev mode (port 5002)      |
| `npm test`                     | Runs tests in all workspaces that have a `test` script |

