### Build Script (No-Op)

```json
"build": "echo '@albert-fe/ui-kit is consumed as workspace source by apps (no bundling step needed)' && exit 0"
```

This is important: **ui-kit is consumed as source** by all apps. There is no `dist/` folder and no bundling step. Every app imports from `node_modules/@albert-fe/ui-kit` which symlinks to `packages/ui-kit/src/index.js`.

