## 9. Vitest Configurations

All apps and packages that have tests use **Vitest** (not Jest). Test configs are in `vitest.config.js` files.

### 9.1 Host (`apps/host/vitest.config.js`)

```js
plugins: [react()]
css.modules.generateScopedName: "[local]"
test.environment: "jsdom"
test.setupFiles: ["./src/test/setup.js"]
```

### 9.2 MF Causes (`apps/mf-causes/vitest.config.js`)

```js
plugins: [react()]
css.modules.generateScopedName: "[local]"
